@startuml
title Activity Diagram: Search for a Stock

|User|
start
:Enter ticker symbol or company name;

|UI|
:Request instrument search;

|System|
:Search instruments;

if (Results found?) then (yes)
  |UI|
  :Display search results;

  |User|
  :Select desired stock;

  |UI|
  :Show loading feedback;
  :Request stock data;

  |System|
  :Fetch quote, historical data,\nand related news;

  if (Data available?) then (yes)
    |UI|
    :Display stock dashboard;
  else (no)
    |UI|
    :Show unavailable-data message;
  endif

else (no)
  |UI|
  :Show empty-state message;
  :Prompt user to try another search;
endif

|User|
stop
@enduml
